arbeitnow:senior-frontend-engineer-full-:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🦄 DataDome&lt;/strong&gt; delivers real-time bot and agent trust management, enabling businesses to trust the intent behind their traffic—human, bot, or AI agent. Named a Leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Bot And Agent Trust Management Q2 2026, DataDome is trusted by enterprises like Etsy, PayPal, and Soundcloud. Acting as a traffic control plane, DataDome's multi-layered AI engine leverages thousands of models and 5 trillion signals daily, analyzing the intent of every session so only trusted traffic reaches your business — powering growth across your sites, apps, APIs, and MCP servers. Backed by a 24/7 SOC and expert threat researchers, DataDome stops 20k+ attacks every second. With 35+ global PoPs, and 80+ ready-made integrations, DataDome is a recognized Leader on G2 across several categories—delivering traffic you can trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Dashboard technical stack is mainly composed of ElasticSearch &amp;amp; MariaDB for the storage, Symfony 8 &amp;amp; Angular 21. Our infrastructure is deployed on AWS, GCP and Azure, using Docker, Ansible and Terraform, and monitored with Grafana, Prometheus &amp;amp; DataDog. We're also heavily invested in integrating AI into our engineering workflows, and expect the same from anyone joining the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Dashboard team is currently composed of a mixture Fullstack, Backend &amp;amp; Frontend engineers, and is looking for a Frontend-strong engineer to help us design and develop our current product. Some of our best engineers started specialized and grew into full-stack over time — if that's a path you want, the team supports it, but there's no expectation to do so.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be more specifically in charge of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing new features in our customer dashboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving the frontend performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finding and fixing bug reports from our Q/A process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and fixing production bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning and evaluating the issues to work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using AI tools as part of your day-to-day engineering workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning topics you want to push forward — from idea to delivery, with real autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging directly with stakeholders to shape and defend your proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You're the perfect candidate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have been building applications for 4+ years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong, hands-on experience with Angular 17 or newer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You're comfortable using AI-assisted tools to speed up and improve your engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about code quality, simplicity and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your growth path:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you want to, you can grow into full-stack over time — picking up Symfony/PHP with support from the team, at your own pace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is entirely optional and up to you: staying and deepening your frontend expertise is just as valid a path here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whichever direction you choose becomes part of your ongoing career path conversations — and for the right person, motivated and driven, there's real room to grow further, whether that's deepening technical expertise or moving into a leadership role as the team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Symfony or another PHP framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You've worked at high scale with systems like MariaDB, Redis or ElasticSearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You wrote your own crawler once or twice before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how internet works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a BS/MS/PhD in a scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Life:&lt;/strong&gt; While we offer remote, hybrid, &amp;amp; in-office options each position specifies the level of flexibility. Our Parisian office is located next to the Opera Garnier. You will also receive a 500€ stipend to help you set up your ideal workspace if you work hybrid or remotely.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are full remote, the SNCF dicount card is paid for you to come to our office to visit us &amp;amp; your team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Health Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We have partnered with Kenko for your healthcare needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 100€ annual allowance is provided for a leisure activity of your choice in Sports or Culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual allowance of €200 if you come to the office by bike to cover maintenance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development&lt;/strong&gt;: #Weaimhigh is part of our DNA, therefore we have invested in an internal Learning and Development platform and offer the opportunity to request additional training and support via your manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events &amp;amp; Team building: #We care and we have fun!&lt;/strong&gt; We organise ****Annual Company-Offsite, Events, Drinks, Winter Party, Lunch &amp;amp; Learns and much more are part of our Culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parent Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on the country you are based from (e.g. 25 days in France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Talent Acquisition Manager : first interview and cultural fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Engineering Manager : technical and cultural fit + Take-home technical challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Team: Presentation and review of your "technical proposal" with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Member of the leadership team - Discussion about DataDome vision and "raison d'être"!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Now you really met everyone! Welcome to DataDome :)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DataDome is an equal opportunity employer, and is proud to be committed to diversity and inclusiveness. We will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability, or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-ai-specialist-leeds-390:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi 👋 we’re Genio. We create beautifully simple learning tools that boost knowledge, skills, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career track:&lt;/strong&gt; IC4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Shared services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior AI Specialist, you will drive practical, effective AI adoption across all functions at Genio, empowering commercial, operational, and engineering teams to build and run their own workflows. In this hands-on technical role, you will lead company-wide enablement: training staff to create custom skills and automations, curating a centralized best-practices library, providing first-line technical support, and building custom Python or JavaScript integrations when off-the-shelf software falls short. Working alongside leadership, your success is measured by what the rest of the company can independently build and achieve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enablement, Coaching &amp;amp; Training: Coach and train employees across all departments to build, test, and maintain their own AI skills and workflows through structured onboarding, hands-on workshops, hackathons, and drop-in support hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills Library &amp;amp; Content Curation: Surface, refine, and document high-performing workflows and prompt patterns from across the company into a centralized library, directly authoring custom solutions to fill operational capability gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Integrations &amp;amp; Automation: Build and maintain API-based integrations, system connectors, and custom scripts using Python or JavaScript when standard platform configurations are insufficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User Support &amp;amp; System Debugging: Provide reliable technical support for AI tooling, investigate connector failures or unexpected model outputs, and incorporate root-cause fixes into ongoing training and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Governance, Security &amp;amp; Tool Evaluation: Partner with IT, InfoSec, and Compliance to manage access permissions, maintain an up-to-date tool inventory, evaluate third-party software using a buy-over-build approach, and run secure software trials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👥 Meet the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be reporting directly into the Head of Business Operations (known internally as BizOps) and working most closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal Platform Engineer and Principal Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Product Analysts (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT, InfoSec, and GTM Systems Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal stakeholders across all business divisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enablement Mindset &amp;amp; Communication: Motivated by teaching others to build technical solutions, with clear, patient communication skills capable of engaging both non-technical team members and experienced software engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Integration Expertise: Hands-on experience with LLM APIs, agentic tooling, and workflow automation platforms, supported by strong programming skills in Python and/or JavaScript to build custom API integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Practical AI Experience: Active personal use of AI tools and agents in day-to-day work, backed by concrete examples of built automations, metric tracking, and failure handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Debugging &amp;amp; Technical Problem-Solving: Proven ability to investigate, diagnose, and resolve technical faults across both system integrations and AI outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Security &amp;amp; Governance: Practical understanding of security boundaries, access controls, and data privacy requirements when deploying AI agents with system, browser, or file-level permissions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pragmatic Curation &amp;amp; Evaluation: Strong judgment in evaluating emerging software based on measurable performance and determining which custom workflows should be standardized company-wide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰 Salary and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;£70,000 - £80,000 dependent upon experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ 33 days annual leave (Inclusive of bank holidays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎄 3 gifted days off at Christmas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💰 EMI Share Options Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 Generous individual learning and training allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⌚ Truly flexible hours to suit when you work best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Full home working set up and beautiful collaborative office space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚗 Free Leeds City Centre office parking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Nomad working policy with family travel insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍼 Enhanced 26 weeks maternity and 4 weeks paternity (fully paid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤍 Health cash plan (from glasses to massages)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 6% employer pension contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍 Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beautiful office space in Leeds is our key hub for collaboration, and we love to get together in person. We operate a flexible hybrid working model, including supporting our Genios who are based remotely across the UK. If you are more than 50 miles away from the office, we offer full remote working support, with the opportunity to join colleagues for in-person collaboration several times a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will discuss ways of working with you at interview however if you have any questions before you apply please reach out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📄 Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We think it’s important that you understand how we use and handle your personal information, so here’s a link to our &lt;a href="https://glean.co/glean-applicant-privacy-notice"&gt;privacy notice.&lt;/a&gt; By submitting your application, you’re confirming that you’ve read and understood this notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:android-software-engineer-lill:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="4"&gt;Notre équipe&lt;strong data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="6"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Sports&lt;/strong&gt; recherche un·e &lt;strong data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="41"&gt;Software Engineer Android &lt;/strong&gt;basé·e à&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="68"&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre sens : &lt;strong&gt;"Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all."&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Chez Decathlon, notre ambition est claire : rassembler autour du sport et rendre le bien-être accessible au plus grand nombre. &lt;br&gt;Pour donner vie à cet objectif, nous nous appuyons sur deux forces majeures :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nos coéquipiers, qui sont le cœur battant de notre écosystème.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Notre ancrage local, qui nous lie à chaque communauté sportive pour offrir des solutions uniques (produits, services et expériences).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour propulser cette vision, le Digital est un levier clé.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ton futur terrain de jeu : la Digital Sport Unit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Véritable trait d'union entre nos marques sportives et le digital, cette équipe conçoit les solutions de demain. &lt;br&gt;En nous rejoignant, tu auras un impact direct : tu contribueras à créer et déployer des produits, services et expériences digitales pour simplifier le quotidien de nos coéquipiers et enchanter la pratique de nos utilisateurs sportifs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le &lt;strong&gt;Connected Locker&lt;/strong&gt;, c'est le cœur logiciel qui fait le pont entre tous nos produits physiques (vélos, tapis, montres) et l'écosystème digital de Decathlon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ton défi ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Absorber la complexité.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Chaque produit a ses propres protocoles et spécificités hardware ; le rôle du CL est d'unifier tout cela dans une librairie&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;modulaire&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;et robuste pour que les développeurs d'applications (Decathlon HUB, Mobility..) puissent intégrer n'importe quel équipement en quelques lignes de code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TES MISSIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Architecture Modulaire &amp;amp; Design de SDK :&lt;/strong&gt; Concevoir et faire évoluer une architecture Kotlin découplée et évolutive, permettant d'ajouter de nouveaux types de produits sans réécrire le cœur du système..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="17,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;onnectivité Hybride &amp;amp; IoT :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtriser le stack Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) sous Android (gestion des cycles de vie, scans, reconnexions, spécificités constructeurs/ROMs) pour le local, et le MQTT/REST pour la communication Cloud&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement d'une "Test App" :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Développer et maintenir une application de test dédiée (Jetpack Compose).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Permettre aux QA de valider les fonctionnalités du SDK en isolation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer des outils de simulation (mocking) pour tester les cas d'erreurs hardware difficiles à reproduire en réel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="17,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Abstraction (L'Art du SDK Android) :&lt;/strong&gt; Créer des API publiques simples et idiomatiques (Kotlin Coroutines / Flow) pour masquer la complexité des machines d'états hardware aux applications utilisatrices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Langage :&lt;/strong&gt; Kotlin (100%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Asynchronisme :&lt;/strong&gt; Coroutines, StateFlow / SharedFlow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Connectivité / IoT :&lt;/strong&gt; Android BLE Stack, MQTT (ex: Paho/HiveMQ), AWS IoT Core, REST / WebSockets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;UI (Test App) :&lt;/strong&gt; Jetpack Compose&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Injection :&lt;/strong&gt; Clean Architecture, Dependency Injection (Hilt / Koin)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,5,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,5,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Outillage / CI-CD :&lt;/strong&gt; Gradle (Build Logic / Version Catalogs), Git, CI/CD pipelines pour publication de SDK/AAR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE DONT TU AS BESOIN POUR RÉUSSIR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es un·e &lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="11"&gt;expert·e Kotlin / Android&lt;/strong&gt; avec une vraie &lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="52"&gt;vision "Plateforme / SDK"&lt;/strong&gt; (tu penses bibliothèque/AAR recontextualisable avant de penser écran/UI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises le &lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,1,0" data-index-in-node="16"&gt;BLE sous Android&lt;/strong&gt; et connais ses pièges (permissions, restrictions arrière-plan, variations selon les versions d'OS/constructeurs), et tu es à l'aise avec les protocoles réseau temps réel (MQTT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une solide expérience en &lt;strong&gt;architecture logicielle&lt;/strong&gt; (Design Patterns, Modularité, Injection de dépendances).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es basé à &lt;strong&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;, prêt à tester ton code sur les machines de sport à 50m de ton bureau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une appétence forte pour le travail en équipe et une culture du partage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un intérêt pour l’impact du sport sur le développement personnel et collectif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’envie de rejoindre une entreprise engagée dans le Tech4Good et l’innovation responsable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POURQUOI NOUS REJOINDRE ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous mettons un point d’honneur à offrir un cadre de travail épanouissant et motivant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride (2 jours de télétravail par semaine);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac, Windows, ou Chromebooks) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d'un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, certifications techniques dès la première année, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (participation des employés aux actions de l'entreprise, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Un environnement de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; : entreprise certifiée &lt;strong&gt;Great Place to Work&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Happy Trainees&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Des avantages attractifs&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;(après 3 mois d’ancienneté)&lt;/em&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes mensuelles, intéressement, actionnariat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantages CSE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25% de réduction&lt;/strong&gt; sur nos produits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remboursement de 50%&lt;/strong&gt; du titre de transport &amp;amp; aide à la mobilité urbaine&lt;br&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Un accompagnement sur mesure&lt;/strong&gt; : coaching, formations internes et externes, partage de connaissances.&lt;br&gt;⚡ &lt;strong&gt;Une culture du sport et du test produit&lt;/strong&gt; : deviens ambassadeur.trice de nos innovations et rejoins nos équipes sportives internes !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je ne connais pas le secteur du sport, ai-je ma place chez Decathlon ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien sûr ! Nous recherchons avant tout des personnes &lt;strong&gt;passionnées&lt;/strong&gt; et motivées, que ce soit dans leur domaine d’expertise ou par le sport en général.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d'offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C'est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l'environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:technical-architect-berlin-380:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.workato.com/" data-tooltip-link-label="undefined"&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;. We are driven by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;and looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.workato.com/careers"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the back of high customer demand and as part of our ongoing and successful Professional Services build out in EMEA, we are looking for an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Technical Architect, &lt;/strong&gt;experienced in SAP projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participating as a SAP integration SME and architect in professional services engagements, focused in particular but not only on integration and automation with SAP ecosystem (SAP ECC, S/4HANA, SaaS applications) as well as on migrations from other platforms to Workato&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working on customized customer onboarding, statements of work and other customer facing activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being a Workato evangelist with the ability to discover and demonstrate how Workato can effectively help companies with their business automation needs across a broad set of industries through professional services engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Becoming the trusted technical advisor to customers and partners from an overall solution, architecture and implementation perspective for the Workato platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contributing to our global SAP practice by creating or enhancing content such as Workato Community content, reference demos and presentations,, white papers, best practices, architecture patterns, and online courses for use by customers, partners and Workato teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through professional services engagements, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead business requirements sessions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop architectural designs for customer integrations and automations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct recipe reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise on unit, integration and user acceptance testing best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct production readiness assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise on production deployment procedures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct post-live deployment health checks and guidance on recipe and process optimizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide thorough knowledge transfer to customer and partner teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply and advise on frameworks, such as Workato’s GEARS and Workato’s Embedded Product Guide, to align with customer organizations’ needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be embedded in customers’ organisations and rapidly understand and absorb their current business process and levers and advise on how they can be improved through automation, orchestration or adoption of other Workato platform features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of technology transformation consulting, including implementation experience with one or more common integration or middleware solutions and/or API management solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in end-to-end solution architecture and implementation on SAP PI/PO and SAP Integration Suite. Knowledge of SAP BC, SAP AIF, SAP iRPA and SAP BTP services (such as AI, SAP Build etc.) is beneficial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of SAP interfacing technologies, configuration and troubleshooting&amp;nbsp; (IDoc, RFC, OData, SOAP WebServices etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with SAP architecture, key SAP methodologies and frameworks (Clean Core, ISA-M etc.) Proven results leading and overseeing customer and/or partner success in the following domains: front-end and back-end solution architecture, enterprise architecture, development, and test/release management strategies, change management, and direct leadership in designing solutions that meet or exceed customer needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep understanding of security and governance needs for large corporations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to travel to the client site up to 25%, but may be higher or lower based on prevailing circumstances&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Business English fluency (written and verbal)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience as an Enterprise and/or digital architect preferably in consulting engagements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Master’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of key applications such as Salesforce, Netsuite, Workday, ServiceNow,&amp;nbsp; EBusiness Suite, Database&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of AWS, Azure, GCP, and programming languages Ruby, ABAP, Java, Groovy, JS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience having worked in a global start-up environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SAP or other relevant certifications (AWS, Microsoft etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;German language knowledge B1 and higher&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2820)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:agentic-systems-engineer-digit:
&lt;h2&gt;About us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cambridge Consultants, we believe the future of technology isn't just smart, it has agency. We're moving past passive tools and building human-centred digital services and products: systems that reason, plan, and act around the people who use them. Our work spans autonomous systems at the frontier of biology, sensing, and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire self-motivated builders, not ticket-takers. If you thrive in highly agile environments, can cut through ambiguity with first-principles thinking, and want to ship things that matter, this is the kind of place where you'll feel at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll be working on systems that haven't existed before. Think of an Agentic Coach that navigates the unpredictability of human biology, or the software architecture behind a fully automated Dark Lab. These aren't chatbots waiting for questions. They're proactive systems that maintain world models, interpret human intent, and intervene before the user knows to ask. These systems create genuine impact for clients tackling problems no one else can solve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building them means designing and wiring agent harnesses: layered architectures that span from sensor-edge reasoning to high-level planning, backed by stateful multi-turn reasoning, persistent per-user memory, and robust evaluation pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll work in two directions at once. Internally, you'll use the latest AI tools to sharpen how we build, prototype, and ship. Externally, you'll deliver the breakthrough systems our clients deploy, designed to move from prototype to production at pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There's no single technology stack. You'll work with agents, multi-agent systems, and the latest generative AI tools, but your work will always be grounded in solid software engineering. Expect to build scalable distributed systems in core languages like Python and TypeScript, leveraging frameworks such as NextJS and Pydantic, agent orchestration tools (LangGraph, CrewAI), and protocols like MCP. You'll deploy on cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure) using Docker, Kubernetes, and infrastructure-as-code, backed by rigorous CI/CD and observability (OpenTelemetry, Prometheus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to the clients we work with, you must be eligible for UK security clearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we ask of you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The examples below describe the core domains our AI Engineers own within the Digital Services team. We don't expect every candidate to have mastered all of these, but if you can demonstrate a strong combination of the following, we'd love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI System Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing and implementing the logic for autonomous systems, including maintaining world models, integrating multimodal sensing, and building real-time human-machine interaction loops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Production Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing the underlying software for scalable, secure, and observable cloud deployments. You will apply the engineering rigor required to take experimental AI from concept to robust live launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid Client Prototyping:&lt;/strong&gt; Driving a demo-first delivery model. You will focus on fast experimentation to actively show tangible value and working software to clients, rather than describing it in slide decks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Translation &amp;amp; Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partnering directly with deep-tech subject matter experts (like biologists and roboticists) to apply software solutions to complex physical constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Indicators you'll be a good fit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied AI Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You have hands-on experience utilising multi-agent frameworks, long-term memory systems, RAG pipelines, vector/graph databases, and reasoning-loop patterns (such as ReAct and Chain-of-Thought).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Software Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess strong programming skills in Python and TypeScript, coupled with practical experience in cloud engineering, containerisation, and modern DevOps. You know that great agents still require rock-solid software foundations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Tolerance for Ambiguity:&lt;/strong&gt; You are energised by uncertainty and shifting targets. You treat changing requirements as a normal part of frontier work, and you know exactly when to ship a rough prototype to learn quickly versus when to slow down for architectural rigour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Disciplinary Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You can seamlessly navigate the gap between code and reality, collaborating with clients, roboticists, and scientists to clearly deliver the "art of the possible."&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Variety of work: &lt;/strong&gt;Projects spanning biotech, finance, robotics, and beyond. No two engagements look alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous learning: &lt;/strong&gt;A mentoring and learning package shaped by your goals, backed by squad-based knowledge sharing across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering autonomy: &lt;/strong&gt;A free hand in choosing the right tools and processes. We trust your engineering judgement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to world-class experts: &lt;/strong&gt;You'll share a building with biologists, roboticists, electronics engineers, and mathematicians. Few places let you tap that range of expertise on a single project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working environment:&lt;/strong&gt; We're flexible about where you work on a day-to-day basis. We also love the energy of collaborating in person, so we’d love you to be in Cambridge for key meetings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-ux-ui-designer-cro-lond:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior UX/UI or Product Designer with a specialized focus on Conversion Rate Optimisation (CRO) and experimentation to join our dynamic, flexible team, embedded directly within our dedicated CRO squad.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled and passionate UX/UI or Product Designer with a specialized focus on Conversion Rate Optimisation (CRO) and experimentation to join our dynamic, flexible team, embedded directly within our dedicated CRO squad. This hybrid role is for a hands-on designer who excels at crafting, optimizing, and delivering high-performing digital experiences across desktop and mobile. You will design premium web experiences and landing pages that drive user engagement, maximize conversions, and seamlessly support business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be instrumental in translating user data, behaviour analytics, and strategic hypotheses into high-impact design variations and optimized user journeys. Working collaboratively within a cross-functional CRO squad, you will be responsible for the end-to-end design lifecycle of A/B and multivariate tests, ensuring every design is both meticulously executed and strategically optimized for maximum performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a hands-on, highly motivated, and self-sufficient UX/UI or Product Designer with deep expertise in conversion-centered design principles, web/mobile usability, and data-driven Optimisation. Your passion for user-centric design pushes you to create intuitive, efficient, and visually stunning digital experiences that perform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversion-Centered Design &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the end-to-end UX/UI design process&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for A/B testing, multivariate testing, landing pages, and ongoing Optimisation initiatives across web and mobile platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop detailed user flows, interaction models, wireframes, and interactive, high-fidelity prototypes&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;specifically optimized for experimentation and user validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create pixel-perfect UI designs&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;that respect and elevate our clients' brand guidelines, utilizing persuasive design patterns, psychological triggers, and clear, conversion-focused hierarchies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with and support tokenized design systems (DS)&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring scalability, efficiency, and consistency of components across a multi-brand environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and optimize unique, tailored user journeys for our client's portfolio of sub-brands&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring sub-brand visual identities and unique experiences are maintained while adhering to core design system architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus on landing page layouts&lt;/strong&gt;, micro-interactions, persuasive copywriting placement, and checkout/signup funnel Optimisation to systematically minimize friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate user feedback, testing data, and statistical results from A/B tests&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;into actionable, iterative design recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure all experiment designs are technically feasible&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and collaborate closely with developers during implementation, providing detailed specifications and reviewing builds to ensure high-fidelity execution of tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; CRO Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work closely with CRO Strategists, Web Analysts, Product Managers, and front-end Developers&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in a fast-paced, agile squad environment to manage multiple experimentation pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocate for data-informed, evidence-based design decisions&lt;/strong&gt;, presenting design concepts and experimentation rationale clearly to clients and stakeholders to build alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Actively contribute to and maintain conversion-oriented design libraries&lt;/strong&gt;, templates, and documented best practices to scale our Optimisation efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience designing for A/B testing, personalisation, CRO, or landing page optimisation would be a bonus, particularly where design decisions have been informed by user insight, performance data, or test learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tokenized Design Systems (DS) Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deep understanding of working with and leveraging tokenized design systems (design tokens in Figma) to manage styling variables, thematic brand changes, and cross-platform consistency efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Brand Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven ability to design distinct and unique user journeys for a client's various sub-brands, striking the perfect balance between brand customization and core systemic rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Commerce &amp;amp; Product Context:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience designing high-converting experiences for e-commerce, transactional websites, lead-generation pages, or digital products is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A must-have portfolio showing a clear end-to-end design process, specifically highlighting how you use user insights, data, or test hypotheses to design landing pages, optimized user flows, and successful A/B test variations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mastery of UX &amp;amp; Conversion Principles:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deep understanding of user psychology, persuasive design, usability standards, responsive layouts, and platform-specific UX/UI guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Figma &amp;amp; Prototyping Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exceptional proficiency in Figma, with the ability to create structured, scalable design files, component libraries, and realistic prototypes for testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Understanding:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Solid understanding of front-end capabilities (HTML, CSS, and basic JavaScript limitations) to ensure your Optimisation designs are technically feasible and performant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Agility:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong communication skills, with a collaborative mindset, comfortable presenting design rationale to stakeholders and working in fast-paced agile development/testing cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility &amp;amp; Performance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong understanding of web accessibility (WCAG) and page performance considerations to design fast, inclusive, and seamless experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;How we use AI in the recruitment process:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;&lt;span class="SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class="SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0" lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;To ensure more focused and engaging conversations, we&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;leverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI in our recruitment process exclusively for secure, objective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;note-taking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;, never for evaluative judgments. This allows our team to be fully present with you. You are always welcome to request a transcript of these notes or opt out of this feature at any time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Opting out will not&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;impact&amp;nbsp; the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;outcome of the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class="p1"&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href="http://wpp.com/"&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="normaltextrun"&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="scxw176048299"&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click "Submit Application", this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it's a good idea to read through our &lt;a href="https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy"&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice"&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:principal-sales-engineer-uk-53:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it's not just something we provide our customers. It's something that inspires our company. People don't come here to join a culture that's built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html"&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we're changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Sales Engineer, you will work side by side with our sales team on engaging and interactive customer focused meetings, demonstrations, and proof of concepts that articulate the business and technical value a customer will receive from our solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have the opportunity to exercise deep technical and consultative skills while leveraging your soft skills to engage with customers throughout all pre-sales phases of customer engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with customer teams, from C-level executives to developers, rapidly understanding a customer’s technical needs, how it enables their business initiatives, and deliver back an insightful and innovative solution that targets those needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business and technology delivery of various pre-sales activities including; planning/developing/delivering conceptual solution demonstrations and presentations, providing technical/product guidance to customers/partners/team, hands on delivery of proof of concepts, and responding to RfXs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with other team members, Product Management and Product/Platform Engineering and Support in providing the right deep technical expertise for our prospects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or assist team members in building out demos of our solutions and platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace the collaborative culture in Ping by helping out other team members no matter which region they are in, ensuring we succeed as a company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guarantee a continuous handover between the teams when navigating between pre- and post-sales phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as pre-sales lead for prospect opportunities working with other Ping teams and partners and Account Executive to convert the prospect into a customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The travel volume is 20-30%.&amp;nbsp;This will mostly in the UK but may also involve EMEA wide travel occasionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in a solution pre-sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise of working with Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM) solutions in or with enterprise organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IAM related protocols and formats such as: OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, SCIM, LDAP, JSON, XML, SQL, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with installation and configuration of one or more IAM technologies from: Ping Identity, Ping, CA, Oracle, IBM, Novell/NetIQ/Microfocus, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience acting as a recognized leader, providing guidance and support for the extended Sales Engineering team, and handling the most complex and difficult sales opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial consultative skills, ability to interface with various levels including architects, developers, managers, CTO and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with a high level of self-direction and/or collaboratively with other teams within Ping Identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to relate proposed solution technical capabilities back to customer needs in a narrative style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competency with scripting languages (JavaScript, Groovy, etc.), RESTful Web Services and web development frameworks such as Node.JS and &lt;a href="http://vue.js"&gt;Vue.js&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep product and technical expertise, with the ability to independently run a Proof of Concept to successful completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead a meeting across all different personas e.g. C-Level, Business owners, Architects, and Developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and delivering technical presentations, workshops, customized demonstrations, and proof of concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General networking concepts and technologies such as: TCP/IP, HTTP/S, routing, load balancers, proxies, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Platforms - AWS, GCP, or Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility to work in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-sales-engineer-public-s:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;As an Enterprise Sales Engineer, you will provide technical expertise through sales presentations, product demonstrations, and supporting technical evaluations (POVs). Sales Engineers help qualify and close opportunities with customers and partners and have a voice with the product team to help prioritize features based on input from customers, competitors, and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Partner with the Sales team to articulate the overall Datadog value proposition, vision and strategy to customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Own technical engagement with customers during the trial phase. Communicate Datadog’s value based on activities and work with customers on any identified issues or concerns to successful conclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Technically close complex opportunities through advanced competitive knowledge, technical skill, and credibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Deliver product and technical briefings / presentations to potential clients&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Maintain accurate notes and feedback in CRM regarding customer input both wins and losses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Proactively engage and communicate with customers and Datadog business/technical teams regarding product feedback and competitive landscape&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Passionate about educating customers on observability risks that are meaningful to their business, and able to build and execute an evaluation plan with a customer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Someone with strong written and oral communication skills. This role requires an ability to understand and articulate both the business benefits (value proposition) and technical advantages of our offering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experienced in programming/scripting with any of the following: Java, Python, Ruby, Go, Node.JS, PHP, and .NET etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Someone with a minimum of 3+ years in a Sales Engineering or DevOps Engineering role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Able to sit up to 4 hours, traveling to and from client sites&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Able to travel via auto, train or air up to 45% of the time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That's okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Best-in-breed onboarding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;An inclusive company culture, able to join our Community Guilds and Inclusion Talks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en" target="_blank"&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog" target="_blank"&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://learn.datadoghq.com/" target="_blank"&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="215"&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href="https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href="https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/" target="_blank"&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform" target="_blank"&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="662"&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="662"&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="c-link" href="https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/" target="_blank" data-stringify-link="https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/" data-sk="tooltip_parent"&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href="https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/" target="_blank"&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>
